t power given by the RRC parameter od-ss-PBCH-BlockPower. The downlink CSI-RS EPRE is derived from the on-demand SSB downlink transmit power given by the RRC parameter od-ss-PBCH-BlockPower and CSI-RS power offset given by the RRC parameter powerControlOffsetSS. Adopt the following TP for clause 4.1 of TS 38.214. --------------------------------------- Start of the TP for TS 38.214-------------------------------------------

